      "id": "CE-DOCS-SCOPE",
      "rule": "Documentation-first, at most one coherent mechanical source cluster by default. Preserve numerical/scientific semantics, live ownership, generated authority state and immutable evidence. Final source paths and status must be checked after intervening packages.",
      "severity": "error"
    },
    {
      "id": "CE-DOCS-EVIDENCE",
      "rule": "Public results are source-linked and scoped. No invented data, timing-phase substitution, hidden selection of only winning points, or historical summary presented as a new run. Existing GPU resource control remains required.",
